  "blocks": [
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": true,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "边分解因式的方法更方便."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "举例说，对于方程 $x^2-1.21=0$ 得到："
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$(x+1.1)(x-1.1)=0$，"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$x=-1.1$ 或 $x=1.1$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "方程 $7x^2=0$ 只有一个根，等于 0."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "解二次方程时，有时利用写成另一种形式的根的公式比",
        "较方便."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "把分式 $\\frac{-b\\pm\\sqrt{D}}{2a}$ 的分子和分母除以 2 并且把因数 $\\frac{1}{2}$ 移到根号",
        "下面. 得到："
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$\\frac{-b\\pm\\sqrt{D}}{2a}=\\frac{-\\frac{b}{2}\\pm\\frac{1}{2}\\sqrt{D}}{a}=\\frac{-\\frac{b}{2}\\pm\\sqrt{\\frac{D}{4}}}{a}$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "因为 $D=b^2-4ac$，所以 $\\frac{D}{4}=\\frac{b^2-4ac}{4}=\\frac{b^2}{4}-ac$，就是 $\\frac{D}{4}↵=\\left(\\frac{b}{2}\\right)^2-ac$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "二次方程的求根公式可以写成下面的形式，就是："
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$x=\\frac{-\\frac{b}{2}\\pm\\sqrt{\\frac{D}{4}}}{a}$，其中　$\\frac{D}{4}=\\left(\\frac{b}{2}\\right)^2-ac$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "写成这种形式的公式，可以用来解判别式不是负值的任何二次方",
        "程（显然，如果 $D\\geq0$，那么 $\\frac{D}{4}\\geq0$）. 实际上，在 $b$ 是偶数（也就是 $\\frac{b}{2}$ 是",
        "整数）的情况下，常常运用这个公式."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "举例说，假设需要解方程"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$9x^2-14x+5=0$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "这里　　$\\frac{b}{2}=-7$，　$a=9$，　$c=5$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$\\frac{D}{4}=(-7)^2-9\\times5=4$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "foot",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "257"
      ]
    }
  ]
